      "accept": "live/work/T12/rle.mjs exports encode(s) and decode(s). encode writes each run of the same character as its decimal count followed by the character (aaabbc gives 3a2b1c; the empty string gives the empty string); characters are whole Unicode code points (an emoji is one character), and input containing a decimal digit throws TypeError. decode is the exact inverse; malformed input (a character without a count, a count without a character, a count of 0) throws SyntaxError. node:test tests in live/work/T12/*.test.mjs",
